          "Content": [
            {
              "id": 46,
              "Title": "Sustainable Practices",
              "Text": "We are committed to **sustainable practices** that protect the environment and support our local community. From energy-efficient lighting and solar heating to waste-reduction initiatives, we strive to minimise our carbon footprint.\n\nWe partner with local suppliers for seasonal produce and **eco-friendly** amenities, and our housekeeping team follows guidelines to conserve water and reduce laundry loads. Discover more about our green policies, recycling stations, and how you can join us in making a positive impact.\n\n#### **Our Sustainable Initiatives include:**\n\n- Green Stay Options: Opt-in to our eco-friendly housekeeping program to help conserve water and energy during your stay.\n- Recycling and Waste Management: Convenient recycling points located throughout the hotel for plastics, glass, paper, and general waste.\n- Eco-friendly Amenities: We choose biodegradable and refillable bathroom products to minimize plastic waste.\n- Local & Seasonal Cuisine: Enjoy dishes featuring fresh, locally sourced ingredients, reducing our environmental impact and supporting nearby farms.\n- Biodiversity Protection: Our gardens and green spaces are designed to encourage native wildlife, providing natural habitats for local species.\n\n\nTogether, we can make a meaningful difference for a healthier planet. Join our journey towards sustainability today!",
              "Media": null,
              "Photoslider": null
            }
          ]
        }
